sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as React App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as Database
    participant GROQ as Groq LLM

    U->>FE: type business question
    FE->>API: POST /api/ai/chat
    API->>DB: query sales, profit, stock data
    DB-->>API: business snapshot

    alt Groq API key configured
        API->>GROQ: send snapshot + question
        GROQ-->>API: natural language answer
    else fallback mode
        API->>API: keyword match on snapshot
    end

    API->>DB: INSERT ai_queries log
    API-->>FE: 200 response
    FE-->>U: display answer
